You have joined the iosk system chat. From here you can send messages to the
other users or interact with the iosk UNIX environment. Anything you type is a
chat message, except for the special case of lines beginning with these special
characters:

    # Lines starting with hash/pound "#" symbol are comments and do nothing.
    # Nobody else will see your comments.

    # Lines starting with dollar sign "$" symbol and a space are commands, e.g.:

    $ echo 'Use the help command to get more help about commands:'
    $ help

As this is an interactive system, take your time and reply just one line
(paragraph) at a time. Enjoy!

